---
// Ported from website/sami/story-map.html. Reuses SamiLayout for the
// shared header/nav/footer chrome, with page-specific styles for the
// real-map SVG and stop-card grid kept local (same pattern RecipeLayout
// pages use for their own block-specific styles).
import SamiLayout from '../../layouts/SamiLayout.astro';
---
<SamiLayout title="Sami's Map">
  <style>
    main { max-width: 900px; }
    main > p { text-align: center; max-width: 700px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; }
    .real-map-section { text-align: center; margin: 40px 0; }
    .real-map-section h2 { color: var(--crust); font-size: 1.5rem; margin: 0 0 4px; }
    .real-map-section .map-caption { font-style: italic; color: #5c4a37; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0 0 20px; }
    .real-map-card { background: #fff; border: 1px solid var(--wheat-200); border-radius: 16px; padding: 20px; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.06); display: inline-block; max-width: 480px; width: 100%; }
    .real-map-card svg { width: 100%; height: auto; display: block; }
    .stops { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(230px, 1fr)); gap: 24px; margin-top: 32px; }
    .stop-card { background: #fff; border: 1px solid var(--wheat-200); border-radius: 16px; padding: 24px; text-align: center; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.06); }
    .stop-card .pin { font-size: 1.8rem; }
    .stop-card h3 { color: var(--crust); margin: 8px 0 6px; }
    .stop-card p { font-size: 0.95rem; color: #5c4a37; margin: 0 0 14px; }
    .stop-card a.recipe-link { color: var(--tomato); text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600; }
    .stop-card a.recipe-link:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
  </style>

  <div class="title-block">
    <h1>Sami's Map</h1>
    <p class="subtitle">Every stop on the journey so far, one crumb trail at a time.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="hero">
    <img src="/images/sami/sami-story-map.jpg" alt="Sami the sourdough sandwich resting on a vintage paper map of Georgia, with small props marking Driftwood Beach, Tallulah Gorge, and the Saturday Farmers Market" />
  </div>

  <main>

    <p>Sami's gotten around more than a sandwich has any right to — and as of the Mammoth Cave trip (with his sister Fari along), the pins have officially escaped Georgia. Here's everywhere the journey has led so far, with more adventures always in the works.</p>

    <div class="real-map-section">
      <h2>The Real Map</h2>
      <p class="map-caption">An actual map of Georgia, pinned with Sami's actual stops. Click a pin to read that adventure.</p>
      <div class="real-map-card">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 600 700" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid meet" overflow="hidden" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" role="img" aria-label="Map of Georgia with three pins — Driftwood Beach, Tallulah Gorge, and the Saturday Farmers Market — plus an arrow pointing off the map toward Mammoth Cave, Kentucky">
          <style>
            .pin-dot { fill: #d9503f; stroke: #ffffff; stroke-width: 2.5; transition: r 0.15s ease; }
            a.pin-link { cursor: pointer; }
            a.pin-link:hover .pin-dot { r: 11; }
            a.pin-link text { fill: #5c4a37; }
            a.pin-link:hover text { fill: #d9503f; }
          </style>
